{
  "mcp_servers": [
    {
      "id": "official-filesystem-workspace",
      "name": "MCP Filesystem（官方 @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem，需 Node/npx）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "official-mcp-fetch",
      "name": "MCP Fetch（官方 mcp-server-fetch，单 URL 抓正文）",
      "command": "__JACHIN_MCP_PYTHON__",
      "args": ["-m", "mcp_server_fetch"],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tavily-search",
      "name": "Tavily Search（联网检索，官方 MCP）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "tavily-mcp@latest"],
      "env": {
        "TAVILY_API_KEY": "${TAVILY_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "com.jachin.mcp.office_powerpoint",
      "name": "Jachin Office PowerPoint MCP（PPTX，可选）",
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "ppt_mcp_server"],
      "env": {
        "PPT_TEMPLATE_PATH": "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/ppt_templates"
      }
    }
  ],
  "_comment": "复制到 ~/.jachin/mcp_servers.json 并与仓库 tools/mcp-official/mcp_servers.jachin.example.json 按需合并。Fetch 项：官方在 PyPI（pip install mcp-server-fetch），勿使用不存在的 npm 包 @modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch；默认遵守 robots.txt（如头条 /trending/ 会被拒）。需自担合规风险时可在 args 末尾加 \"--ignore-robots-txt\"，或设环境变量 JACHIN_MCP_FETCH_IGNORE_ROBOTS=1 由启动逻辑自动追加（见 core/mcp_json_repair.py）。Filesystem：__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__ 展开为 ~/.jachin/workspace。${TAVILY_API_KEY} 等同上。PowerPoint 需 pip install office-powerpoint-mcp-server。L3 启动时会自动补全未配置的 Filesystem/Fetch 默认项。"
}
